3 tasks

Straightforward three-task sequential plan. The main tradeoff worth noting: using subprocess-based
tests gives you real end-to-end CLI verification, but it means the tests won't catch import-level 
issues the way a direct  main()  call would — fine for a toy project, but something to revisit if 
this ever grows legs.

Take a look at the plan and let me know if you'd like any changes, or if it looks good to move 
forward.


