     ◦ [must] Given test_hello.py source code / When Inspected for test methods / Then Contains at
       least test_default_name and test_custom_name methods in a TestCase subclass
     ◦ [must] Given test_default_name executes / When subprocess invokes hello.py with no 
       arguments / Then Asserts stdout.strip() == 'Hello, World!'
   Should
   
